## 1. Architecture Overview

### Layer Position

This plan operates entirely in the **frontend layer**, consuming GraphQL APIs provided by Plan 05. It does not create backend services, repositories, or database schemas. The plan follows the **Siraj three-location split** pattern for dashboard pages: App Router page → Container (common) → Desktop/Mobile tier views.

```
                    ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
                    │               DASHBOARD ROUTE (auth-required)             │
                    │                                                           │
                    │  app/(dashboard)/certificates/templates/                   │
                    │       └─ page.tsx (Server Component)                      │
                    │            │                                              │
                    │            ├─► getServerUserContext()                      │
                    │            ├─► requirePermissionForPage()                │
                    │            ├─► getTranslations(locale)                   │
                    │            └─► <TemplateListContainer />                  │
                    │                 │                                         │
                    │                 ├─► useQuery(CERT_TEMPLATES)              │
                    │                 │      → Apollo Client                    │
                    │                 │      → POST /api/graphql                │
                    │                 │                                         │
                    │                 ├─► useMutation(CREATE_TEMPLATE)          │
                    │                 ├─► useMutation(DUPLICATE_TEMPLATE)       │
                    │                 ├─► useMutation(DELETE_TEMPLATE)          │
