### 4.3 Component Props

#### TemplateListContainer

| Prop | Type | Description |
|------|------|-------------|
| `locale` | `AppLocale` | Locale from server (ar/en) |
| `labels` | `TemplateListLabels` | Translation strings from i18n (all key groups from requirements §6) |

**Responsibilities**: Orchestrates Apollo queries/mutations, Zustand store hydration from URL, debounced search effect, query variable derivation, navigation actions (router.push to editor/preview/generate), dispatches mutations and handles cache updates, renders shared dialogs (CreateTemplateDialog, DeleteConfirmDialog, BulkChangeCategoryDialog), passes ViewModel to ResponsiveViewSwitch.

#### DesktopTemplateListView

| Prop | Type | Description |
|------|------|-------------|
| `viewModel` | `TemplateListViewModel` | Full ViewModel from container (data, loading, error, handlers, labels) |
| `canManage` | `boolean` | User has `CERT_TEMPLATE_MANAGE` permission |
| `canPublish` | `boolean` | User has `CERT_TEMPLATE_PUBLISH` permission |
| `canBulk` | `boolean` | User has `CERT_TEMPLATE_BULK` permission |

**Responsibilities**: Renders `DesktopPageHeader` (title, subtitle, "Create Template" button), `SearchBar` (debounced), `SortSelector` (field + direction dropdown), `FilterButton` (opens FilterPanel), `ViewModeToggle` (grid/table segmented control), and conditionally renders `TemplateCardGrid` or `TemplateTable` based on `viewMode`. Renders `LoadMoreButton`, `SkeletonGrid` (initial load), `ErrorState` (query error), `EmptyState` (no templates / no filter results). Renders `BulkActionBar` (sticky bottom) when `selectedIds.size > 0`.

#### SortSelector (Desktop)

| Prop | Type | Description |
|------|------|-------------|
| `sortBy` | `CertTemplateSortField` | Currently selected sort field |
| `sortDirection` | `SortDirection` | Currently selected sort direction (`'asc'` or `'desc'`) |
| `onSortChange` | `(field: CertTemplateSortField, direction: SortDirection) => void` | Update sort field and direction |
| `labels` | `SortSelectorLabels` | Sort field labels and direction toggle labels |

**Responsibilities**: Renders a `Select` dropdown for the sort field (Name, Last Modified, Status, Element Count, Variable Count, Created Date) and a toggle `IconButton` for direction (ascending/descending arrows). Both persist to URL params (`?sortBy=...&sortDir=...`) and reset the cursor on change. Default: `updatedAt DESC`.

**Available sort fields**:
| Field Key | Label EN | Label AR | Apollo Variable |
|-----------|----------|----------|-----------------|
| `name` | "Name" | "الاسم" | `{ field: 'name', direction }` |
| `updatedAt` | "Last Modified" | "آخر تعديل" | `{ field: 'updatedAt', direction }` (default) |
| `createdAt` | "Date Created" | "تاريخ الإنشاء" | `{ field: 'createdAt', direction }` |
| `status` | "Status" | "الحالة" | `{ field: 'status', direction }` |
| `elementCount` | "Elements" | "العناصر" | `{ field: 'elementCount', direction }` |
| `variableCount` | "Variables" | "المتغيرات" | `{ field: 'variableCount', direction }` |

