| Prop | Type | Description |
|------|------|-------------|
| `viewModel` | `TemplateListViewModel` | Full ViewModel from container (same as desktop) |
| `canManage` | `boolean` | User has `CERT_TEMPLATE_MANAGE` permission |
| `canPublish` | `boolean` | User has `CERT_TEMPLATE_PUBLISH` permission |
| `canBulk` | `boolean` | User has `CERT_TEMPLATE_BULK` permission |

**Responsibilities**: Renders `MobilePageHeader` (title, FAB for "Create Template"), `MobileSearchBar` (sticky top, debounced), `MobileSortSelector` (sort field + direction in bottom sheet), `MobileFilterButton` (opens bottom sheet FilterPanel), `MobileCardList` with `MobileTemplateCard` (compact: icon placeholder, name, status, date, truncated menu), `MobileBulkActionBar` (sticky bottom), `MobileLoadMoreButton`, skeleton/error/empty states.

#### MobileSortSelector (Mobile)

| Prop | Type | Description |
|------|------|-------------|
