**Responsibilities**: Renders status multi-select chips (All, Draft, Published, Archived), orientation multi-select chips (Portrait, Landscape), "Show only my templates" toggle (`Switch`), category hierarchical dropdown (tree from Plan 09 categories), "Clear all filters" button. Shows disabled state for category filter when Plan 09 is not ready (tooltip: "Categories coming soon"). Active filter count badge displayed on the triggering FilterButton. Filter state persists in URL search params (`?orientation=portrait,landscape&ownedByMe=true`).

**Filter interaction states**:
| Interaction | Behavior |
|-------------|----------|
| **Hover** (chip/dropdown) | Chip background lightens; category dropdown item highlights with `theme.palette.action.hover` |
| **Focus** (chip) | Outline ring via `focus-visible`; all chips support keyboard toggle (Space/Enter) |
| **Active/Selected** | Chip shows filled background with `theme.palette.primary.main` color; text is `onPrimary` |
| **Disabled** (category dropdown) | Greyed-out with tooltip "Categories coming soon" when `categoriesLoading` or Plan 09 not ready |
| **Badge** (activeFilterCount) | `Badge` with `color="secondary"` on FilterButton; count = statuses selected + category selected + orientations selected + ownedByMe active |
| **Clear all** | Button text fades from enabled to disabled (greyed out) when `activeFilterCount === 0`; visible but not interactive |

