| `onChangeCategory` | `() => void` | Open change category dialog |
| `onClearSelection` | `() => void` | Clear selection, hide bar |
| `canPublish` | `boolean` | Permission gate for Archive |
| `canManage` | `boolean` | Permission gate for Delete and Change Category |

**Responsibilities**: Renders sticky bottom bar (desktop) or bottom sheet trigger (mobile) showing "X selected". Actions: Archive (requires `CERT_TEMPLATE_PUBLISH`), Delete (requires `CERT_TEMPLATE_MANAGE`), Change Category (requires `CERT_TEMPLATE_MANAGE`). Buttons disabled during mutation loading state. Clear Selection button on far right.

