| `loading` | `boolean` | Whether a bulk mutation is in progress |
| `labels` | `BulkActionBarLabels` | Action labels + selected count (pluralized) |

**Responsibilities**: Sticky bottom bar (`position: fixed`). Shows selected count with Arabic pluralization (`selectedCount(count)` function from i18n). Action buttons (each hidden if user lacks permission). "Cancel" button clears selection and hides bar. Loading spinner on the active action button during mutation. Slide-up animation on appear.

