|------|------|-------------|
| `open` | `boolean` | Dialog visibility |
| `template` | `CertTemplate \| null` | Template being deleted (for name and status display) |
| `onConfirm` | `() => void` | Confirm delete |
| `onCancel` | `() => void` | Cancel delete |
| `loading` | `boolean` | Whether delete mutation is in progress |
| `labels` | `DeleteConfirmDialogLabels` | Warning text (interpolated with status), buttons |

**Responsibilities**: For draft templates: simple "Are you sure?" dialog or immediate delete. For published/archived templates: full warning dialog with interpolated status text: "This template is {status}. Deleting it will remove it from the active list. This action can be undone by an administrator." Confirm and Cancel buttons.

#### BulkChangeCategoryDialog (Shared)

| Prop | Type | Description |
|------|------|-------------|
| `open` | `boolean` | Dialog visibility |
| `selectedCount` | `number` | Number of templates being re-categorized |
| `categories` | `Category[]` | Available categories |
| `onConfirm` | `(categoryId: string) => void` | Confirm with selected category |
| `onCancel` | `() => void` | Cancel |
| `loading` | `boolean` | Whether mutation is in progress |
| `labels` | `BulkChangeCategoryDialogLabels` | Dialog title, instructions, buttons |

**Responsibilities**: MUI `Dialog` with `CategoryPicker` (Autocomplete from Plan 09 categories). Shows selected count. Confirm button calls `bulkChangeCategory` mutation with selected IDs and chosen category.

### 4.4 ViewModel: `useTemplatesViewModel()` Return Type

**File**: `frontend/common/views/dashboard/certificates/templates/useTemplatesViewModel.ts`

The ViewModel hook encapsulates ALL business logic and returns a single flat object consumed by both desktop and mobile tier views. The hook takes `Readonly<TemplateListContainerProps>` (which is `Record<string, never>` — the Page passes no props to the Container, and the Container passes no props to the ViewModel). All mutable state lives in the Zustand store; Apollo data lives in `useQuery`/`useMutation` hooks called inside the ViewModel.

#### ViewModel Interface (TypeScript)

The `TemplateListViewModel` interface is exported from `useTemplatesViewModel.ts` and consumed by both tier views as `Readonly<TemplateListViewModel>`:

**Data fields**:
- `templates: readonly CertTemplate[]` — the `edges[].node` array from the `certTemplates` query, flattened for rendering
- `totalCount: number` — from `CertTemplateConnection.totalCount` (reflects active filters)
- `pageInfo: { readonly hasNextPage: boolean; readonly endCursor: string | null }` — relay pageInfo for Load More
- `loadedCount: number` — derived: `templates.length` (number of items currently loaded)
- `categories: readonly Category[]` — from the `categoryRoots` query; empty array if Plan 09 not ready
- `categoriesLoading: boolean` — true while category query is in flight
- `categoriesDisabled: boolean` — derived: true if Plan 09 category query is skipped/errored (graceful degradation)

**Loading/error/empty states**:
- `loading: boolean` — Apollo query loading (initial load only, not Load More)
- `loadingMore: boolean` — true while `fetchMore` is in flight (Load More button spinner)
- `error: ApolloError | null` — Apollo query error
- `isEmpty: boolean` — derived: `!loading && templates.length === 0 && !hasActiveFilters`
- `isFilteredEmpty: boolean` — derived: `!loading && templates.length === 0 && hasActiveFilters`
- `hasActiveFilters: boolean` — derived: `debouncedSearch !== '' || statusFilter.length > 0 || categoryFilter !== null`

**Store state** (read from Zustand store via selectors):
- `searchQuery: string` — raw search input (for responsive UI)
- `debouncedSearch: string` — debounced value (used in query variables)
- `statusFilter: readonly TemplateStatus[]` — selected status filters
- `categoryFilter: string | null` — selected category UUID
- `orientationFilter: readonly TemplateOrientation[]` — selected orientation filters (portrait, landscape, or both)
- `ownedByMe: boolean` — whether "Show only my templates" filter is active
- `viewMode: 'grid' | 'table'` — desktop view mode preference
- `selectedIds: ReadonlySet<string>` — selected template IDs for bulk actions
- `filterPanelOpen: boolean` — filter panel visibility
- `createDialogOpen: boolean` — create dialog visibility
- `deleteTargetId: string | null` — template being deleted
- `activeFilterCount: number` — derived: count of active filters for badge

**Sort state** (read from Zustand store via selectors):
- `sortBy: CertTemplateSortField` — currently selected sort field (default: 'updatedAt')
- `sortDirection: SortDirection` — currently selected sort direction (default: 'desc')

**Permissions** (read from `useUserStore`):
- `canView: boolean` — user has `CERT_TEMPLATE_VIEW`
- `canManage: boolean` — user has `CERT_TEMPLATE_MANAGE`
- `canPublish: boolean` — user has `CERT_TEMPLATE_PUBLISH`
- `canBulk: boolean` — user has `CERT_TEMPLATE_BULK`

**Labels** (from `useAppTranslation`):
- `labels: TemplateListLabels` — the full typed translation object

**Handlers** (all are `() => void` unless noted):
- `onSearchChange: (query: string) => void` — updates `searchQuery` in store, triggers debounce effect inside ViewModel
- `onStatusFilterChange: (statuses: TemplateStatus[]) => void` — updates `statusFilter`, resets cursor
- `onCategoryFilterChange: (categoryId: string | null) => void` — updates `categoryFilter`, resets cursor
- `onOrientationFilterChange: (orientations: TemplateOrientation[]) => void` — updates `orientationFilter`, resets cursor
- `onOwnedByMeChange: (owned: boolean) => void` — updates `ownedByMe`, resets cursor
- `onClearAllFilters: () => void` — clears all filters (search, status, category, orientation, ownedByMe), resets cursor
- `onClearSearch: () => void` — clears search immediately (no debounce)
- `onViewModeChange: (mode: 'grid' | 'table') => void` — updates `viewMode` in store
- `onSortChange: (field: CertTemplateSortField, direction: SortDirection) => void` — updates sort field and direction, resets cursor
- `onToggleSelect: (id: string) => void` — toggle a template ID in the selection Set
- `onSelectAll: () => void` — select all currently loaded template IDs
- `onClearSelection: () => void` — clear all selections
- `onLoadMore: () => void` — calls `fetchMore` with `endCursor` from `pageInfo`
- `onOpenCreateDialog: () => void` — opens Create Template dialog
- `onCloseCreateDialog: () => void` — closes Create Template dialog
- `onCreateTemplate: (input: CreateTemplateInput) => void` — calls `createTemplate` mutation; on success: closes dialog, navigates to editor, shows toast
- `onDuplicate: (id: string) => void` — calls `duplicateTemplate` mutation; on success: shows toast, updates cache
- `onDeleteRequest: (id: string) => void` — sets `deleteTargetId` in store (opens confirmation dialog)
- `onDeleteConfirm: () => void` — calls `deleteTemplate` mutation; on success: closes dialog, clears target, shows toast, evicts from cache
- `onDeleteCancel: () => void` — closes delete dialog, clears `deleteTargetId`
- `onEdit: (id: string) => void` — `router.push` to `/certificates/templates/${id}/editor`
- `onPreview: (id: string) => void` — `router.push` to `/certificates/templates/${id}/preview`
- `onGenerate: (id: string) => void` — `router.push` to `/certificates/generate/${id}`
- `onBulkArchive: () => void` — calls `bulkArchiveTemplates` with `Array.from(selectedIds)`; on success: clears selection, updates cache, shows toast
- `onBulkDelete: () => void` — calls `bulkDeleteTemplates` with `Array.from(selectedIds)`; on success: clears selection, evicts from cache, shows toast
- `onBulkChangeCategory: (categoryId: string) => void` — calls `bulkChangeCategory` with `Array.from(selectedIds)` and `categoryId`; on success: clears selection, updates cache, shows toast
- `onOpenFilterPanel: () => void` — opens filter panel
- `onCloseFilterPanel: () => void` — closes filter panel
- `onRetry: () => void` — calls `refetch()` on the Apollo query

**Derived values**:
- `availableActions: (template: CertTemplate) => CardAction[]` — filters card actions by permission and template status; returns the subset of `[Edit, Preview, Duplicate, Delete, Generate]` the user can perform for this specific template
- `deleteTarget: CertTemplate | null` — derived: the template object for `deleteTargetId`, or null

**Snackbar feedback** (from store):
- `snackbarOpen: boolean` — whether a snackbar is visible
- `snackbarMessage: string` — the snackbar message text
- `snackbarSeverity: 'success' | 'error' | 'info'` — snackbar severity
- `onCloseSnackbar: () => void` — closes the snackbar

#### Internal Hook Composition

The ViewModel is composed of private sub-hooks, following the billing pattern:
- `useTemplatesTranslations()` — calls `useAppTranslation(Translation.Dashboard.Certificates.Templates.List)` and builds the `TemplateListLabels` object
- `useTemplatesPermissions()` — reads `useUserStore(state => state.hasPermission)` and returns `{canView, canManage, canPublish, canBulk}` booleans
- `useTemplatesStoreState()` — pulls individual store fields via selectors (not an object selector)
- `useTemplatesSearchHandlers(store)` — debounced search with `useDebouncedCallback` from `use-debounce` (300ms); immediate clear; resets cursor on change
- `useTemplatesData(store)` — `useQuery(CertTemplatesQueryDocument, { variables, fetchPolicy: 'cache-and-network', notifyOnNetworkStatusChange: true })`; derives `templates`, `totalCount`, `pageInfo`, `loadedCount`
- `useCategoriesData()` — `useQuery(CategoryListQueryDocument, { fetchPolicy: 'cache-first', skip: false })`; derives `categories`, `categoriesLoading`, `categoriesDisabled`
- `useTemplatesMutations(translations, store, refetch)` — `useMutation` for each of the 6 mutations with `onCompleted`/`onError` hooks that update the Apollo cache and call `showFeedback` on the store
- `useTemplatesActionHandlers(...)` — wraps mutation results into handler functions with permission gating (handlers return `undefined` if the user lacks permission, so the UI component can conditionally render)

### 4.5 Switcher File: `TemplateListView.tsx`

**File**: `frontend/common/views/dashboard/certificates/templates/TemplateListView.tsx`

The switcher file is a thin client component that:
1. Calls `useTemplatesViewModel(props)` to get the ViewModel
2. Calls `createLazyView<Readonly<TemplateListViewModel>>()` at module top level to create lazy-loaded mobile/desktop component references
3. Wraps both in `<ResponsiveViewSwitch>` with the ViewModel as the `props` argument

The switcher imports:

The mobile and desktop tier views via lazy importers (matching the real pattern):
- Mobile: `() => import("@/frontend/mobile/views/dashboard/certificates/templates/templates.mobile").then(m => ({ default: m.MobileTemplateListView }))`
- Desktop: `() => import("@/frontend/desktop/views/dashboard/certificates/templates/templates.desktop").then(m => ({ default: m.DesktopTemplateListView }))`

Passes the full `viewModel` object via `<ResponsiveViewSwitch mobile={lazyViews.mobile} desktop={lazyViews.desktop} props={viewModel} />`.

The switcher itself is NOT permission-gated — that's the Container's job. The switcher only handles the tier selection and Suspense fallback.

### 4.6 Container File: `TemplateListContainer.tsx`

**File**: `frontend/common/views/dashboard/certificates/templates/TemplateListContainer.tsx`

The Container is a `"use client"` component that:
1. Takes no props: `TemplateListContainer(_props: Readonly<Record<string, never>> = {})`
2. Wraps `<TemplateListView />` in `<RequirePermission permissions={[AppPermission.CERT_TEMPLATE_VIEW]} fallback={null}>`
3. Does NOT call the ViewModel hook itself — it delegates that to the switcher file (following the real `ParentBillingContainer` → `ParentBillingView` pattern)
4. Renders shared dialogs that need to be visible regardless of tier (CreateTemplateDialog, DeleteConfirmDialog, BulkChangeCategoryDialog) — these are rendered OUTSIDE the ResponsiveViewSwitch so they survive tier switches

---

## 5. Component Hierarchy

### Full Component Tree

```
app/(dashboard)/certificates/templates/page.tsx (Server Component)
│
├─ getServerUserContext() → userContext
├─ requirePermissionForPage(userContext, 'CERT_TEMPLATE_VIEW')
├─ getLocale() → locale
├─ getTranslations(locale) → t.dashboardTranslations.certificates.templates.list
│
└─ <TemplateListContainer
       locale={locale}
       labels={t.dashboardTranslations.certificates.templates.list} />
    │
    ├─ URL Hydration: useSearchParams() → hydrateFromUrl()
    ├─ Debounce Effect: searchQuery → setTimeout(300ms) → setDebouncedSearch()
    ├─ Query Variables: useMemo(debouncedSearch, statusFilter, categoryFilter, cursor, pageSize)
    │
    ├─ useQuery(CERT_TEMPLATES, {
    │     variables: derived from store,
    │     fetchPolicy: 'cache-and-network',
    │     notifyOnNetworkStatusChange: true
    │   })
    │
    ├─ useQuery(CATEGORY_LIST, {
    │     fetchPolicy: 'cache-first',
    │     skip: !categoryFilterEnabled
    │   })
    │
    ├─ useMutation(CREATE_TEMPLATE) → cache update + navigation
    ├─ useMutation(DUPLICATE_TEMPLATE) → cache update + toast
    ├─ useMutation(DELETE_TEMPLATE) → cache eviction + toast
    ├─ useMutation(BULK_ARCHIVE) → cache update + refetch
    ├─ useMutation(BULK_DELETE) → cache eviction + refetch
    ├─ useMutation(BULK_CHANGE_CATEGORY) → cache update + refetch
    │
    ├─ ViewModel assembly: { data, loading, error, handlers, labels }
    │
    ├─ <ResponsiveViewSwitch
    │     desktop={<DesktopTemplateListView viewModel={...} canManage={...} canPublish={...} canBulk={...} />}
    │     mobile={<MobileTemplateListView viewModel={...} canManage={...} canPublish={...} canBulk={...} />} />
    │
    ├─ Shared Dialogs (rendered at container level):
    │   ├─ <CreateTemplateDialog
    │   │     open={createDialogOpen}
    │   │     onClose={closeCreateDialog}
    │   │     onSubmit={handleCreateTemplate}
    │   │     loading={createLoading}
    │   │     categories={categoryData}
    │   │     categoriesLoading={categoriesLoading}
    │   │     labels={labels.createDialog} />
    │   │
    │   ├─ <DeleteConfirmDialog
    │   │     open={deleteTargetId !== null}
    │   │     template={deleteTarget}
    │   │     onConfirm={handleDeleteConfirm}
    │   │     onCancel={closeDeleteDialog}
    │   │     loading={deleteLoading}
    │   │     labels={labels.deleteDialog} />
    │   │
    │   └─ <BulkChangeCategoryDialog
    │         open={bulkChangeCategoryOpen}
    │         selectedCount={selectedIds.size}
    │         categories={categoryData}
    │         onConfirm={handleBulkChangeCategory}
    │         onCancel={closeBulkChangeCategoryDialog}
    │         loading={bulkChangeCategoryLoading}
    │         labels={labels.bulkChangeCategoryDialog} />
    │
    └─ Navigation handlers:
        ├─ navigateToEditor(id) → router.push(`/certificates/templates/${id}/editor`)
        ├─ navigateToPreview(id) → router.push(`/certificates/templates/${id}/preview`)
        └─ navigateToGenerate(id) → router.push(`/certificates/generate/${id}`)
```

### Desktop View Component Tree

```
<DesktopTemplateListView viewModel={viewModel} canManage={...} canPublish={...} canBulk={...} />
│
├─ <DesktopPageHeader>
│    ├─ <Typography variant="h4">{labels.title}</Typography>
│    ├─ <Typography variant="body2" color="text.secondary">{labels.subtitle}</Typography>
│    ├─ <SearchBar
│    │     value={viewModel.searchQuery}
│    │     onChange={viewModel.onSearchChange}
│    │     placeholder={labels.searchPlaceholder} />
│    ├─ <FilterButton
│    │     activeCount={viewModel.activeFilterCount}
│    │     onClick={viewModel.openFilterPanel} />
│    ├─ <ViewModeToggle
│    │     value={viewModel.viewMode}
│    │     onChange={viewModel.setViewMode}
│    │     gridLabel={labels.viewGrid}
│    │     tableLabel={labels.viewTable} />
│    └─ <Button variant="contained" onClick={viewModel.openCreateDialog}
│         disabled={!canManage}>{labels.createButton}</Button>
│
├─ <FilterPanel /> (when filterPanelOpen — side panel or popover)
│    ├─ Status multi-select chips
│    ├─ Category hierarchical dropdown
│    └─ "Clear all filters" button
│
├─ Conditional rendering based on state:
│    ├─ IF loading (initial): <SkeletonGrid columnCount={3} /> (6 skeleton cards)
│    ├─ IF error: <ErrorState message={error.message} onRetry={refetch} />
│    ├─ IF empty (no templates, no filters): <EmptyState illustration + "Create your first template" button />
│    ├─ IF empty (filters active): <EmptyState illustration + "No templates match your filters" + "Clear filters" button />
│    ├─ IF viewMode === 'grid': <TemplateCardGrid>
│    │    └─ <TemplateCard template={...} selected={...} ... />
│    └─ IF viewMode === 'table': <TemplateTable
│         templates={data.edges}
│         selectedIds={selectedIds}
│         onToggleSelect={...}
│         onRowClick={navigateToEditor}
│         onAction={handleCardAction}
│         actions={availableActions}
│         labels={labels.table} />
│
├─ <LoadMoreButton
│     visible={pageInfo.hasNextPage && loaded < totalCount}
│     loading={loadingMore}
│     onClick={fetchMore}
│     label={labels.pagination.loadMore}
│     loadingLabel={labels.pagination.loading} />
│
├─ <CountDisplay>
│    └─ {labels.pagination.count(loaded, total)} (Arabic pluralized)
│
└─ <BulkActionBar> (when selectedIds.size > 0, sticky bottom)
     ├─ <SelectedCountChip>{labels.selectedCount(count)}</SelectedCountChip>
     ├─ <Button onClick={onArchive} hidden={!canPublish}>{labels.bulkActions.archive}</Button>
     ├─ <Button onClick={onDelete} hidden={!canManage}>{labels.bulkActions.delete}</Button>
     ├─ <Button onClick={onChangeCategory} hidden={!canManage}>{labels.bulkActions.changeCategory}</Button>
     └─ <Button onClick={onClearSelection}>{labels.bulkActions.cancel}</Button>
```

### Mobile View Component Tree

```
<MobileTemplateListView viewModel={viewModel} canManage={...} canPublish={...} canBulk={...} />
│
├─ <MobilePageHeader>
│    ├─ <Typography variant="h5">{labels.title}</Typography>
│    └─ <Fab onClick={viewModel.openCreateDialog} disabled={!canManage}>
│         <AddOutlined /> </Fab>
│
