#### Mobile Component Hierarchy (enhanced)

**File**: `frontend/mobile/views/dashboard/certificates/templates/templates.mobile.tsx`

Exports `MobileTemplateListView({ ...viewModel }: Readonly<TemplateListViewModel>)` — pure render with ZERO hooks, ZERO business logic. Renders:

```
┌─ <MobilePageContainer> (bottom safe-area padding: 80px when bulk bar visible)
│  ├─ <MobilePageHeader>
│  │   ├─ <Typography variant="h5" noWrap> → viewModel.labels.pageTitle
│  │   └─ <Fab color="primary" size="medium" aria-label="create" onClick={viewModel.onOpenCreateDialog} disabled={!viewModel.canManage}>
│  │       <AddOutlined />
│  │
│  ├─ <MobileSearchBar> Sticky top (zIndex above content, below AppBar)
│  │   uses TextField with InputProps endAdornment Clear button when non-empty
│  │   value={viewModel.searchQuery} onChange={(e) => viewModel.onSearchChange(e.target.value)}
│  │   placeholder={viewModel.labels.searchPlaceholder}
│  │
│  ├─ <MobileFilterTrigger> Inline row below search, visible only when templates OR filters present
│  │   ├─ <Chip> clickable, variant outlined, leading icon FilterListOutlined
│  │   │   text={viewModel.labels.filters.title}
│  │   │   badge: { count: viewModel.activeFilterCount } — uses Badge with color="secondary" when > 0
│  │   │   onClick: viewModel.onOpenFilterPanel
│  │   └─ "Clear all" inline text-button when activeFilterCount > 0, onClick=viewModel.onClearAllFilters
│  │
│  ├─ <FilterBottomSheet> (BottomSheet component from @/frontend/common/components/ui/, when viewModel.filterPanelOpen)
│  │   slides up from bottom, dismissible by tap-outside or drag-down
│  │   children: same FilterPanel sub-component used on desktop (status chips + category dropdown + clear all)
│  │   onClose: viewModel.onCloseFilterPanel
│  │
│  ├─ Conditional rendering (same state logic as desktop):
│  │   ├─ IF viewModel.loading (initial): <SkeletonList itemCount={6} /> — 1-column skeleton placeholders matching MobileCardListItem layout
│  │   ├─ IF viewModel.error && !templates.length: <MobileErrorState message={labels.errors.loadFailed} onRetry={viewModel.onRetry} />
│  │   ├─ IF viewModel.isEmpty: <MobileEmptyState title={labels.empty.noTemplatesTitle} description={labels.empty.noTemplatesDescription} />
│  │   │   primaryAction visible only if viewModel.canManage: <Button variant="contained" onClick={viewModel.onOpenCreateDialog}>{labels.empty.createFirstTemplate}</Button>
│  │   ├─ IF viewModel.isFilteredEmpty: <MobileEmptyState title=labels.empty.noMatchesTitle description=labels.empty.noMatchesDescription
│  │   │   primaryAction={ <Button onClick={viewModel.onClearAllFilters}>{labels.empty.clearFilters}</Button> } />
│  │   └─ <MobileCardList> (from @/frontend/common/components/ui/)
│  │       items: viewModel.templates
│  │       renderItem: (template) => <MobileTemplateCard template={template} ... />
│  │       keyExtractor: (t) => t.id
│  │       loadMore: viewModel.pageInfo.hasNextPage
│  │         when true and list scrolled to bottom: <LoadMoreButton inline />
│  │
│  └─ Count display at list end:
│      <Typography variant="caption" color="text.secondary">
│        {viewModel.labels.pagination.count(viewModel.loadedCount, viewModel.totalCount)}
│      </Typography>
└─ <MobilePageContainer /> end

┌─ <MobileBulkActionBar> (sticky bottom — sibling of MobilePageContainer, position fixed bottom)
│  visible when viewModel.selectedIds.size > 0
│  sx: position fixed bottom 0 left 0 right 0 padding 1.5 bgcolor theme.palette.surface boxShadow theme.shadows[8] zIndex appBar
│  children:
│  ├─ <Typography variant="body2" fontWeight="bold">{viewModel.labels.bulkActions.selectedCount(viewModel.selectedIds.size)}</Typography>
│  ├─ <IconButton onClick=viewModel.onBulkArchive hidden=!viewModel.canPublish aria-label labels.bulkActions.archive><ArchiveOutlined /></IconButton>
│  ├─ <IconButton onClick=viewModel.onBulkDelete hidden=!viewModel.canManage aria-label labels.bulkActions.delete><DeleteOutlined /></IconButton>
│  ├─ <IconButton onClick=viewModel.onOpenBulkChangeCategory hidden=!viewModel.canManage aria-label labels.bulkActions.changeCategory><CategoryOutlined /></IconButton>
│  └─ <Button text=viewModel.labels.bulkActions.cancel onClick=viewModel.onClearSelection />
└─ <MobileBulkActionBar /> end
```

#### MobileTemplateCard Layout (MobileCardListItem consumer)

`MobileTemplateCard` renders inside `MobileCardList` — it wraps each template row in a clickable `CardActionArea` with the following layout:

```
<MobileCardListItem> (MUI Card variant="outlined" sx={{ mb: 1, borderRadius: 2, maxWidth: "100%" }})
├─ Row 1 (CardActionArea onClick=viewModel.onEdit(template.id)) — navigates to editor
│  ├─ Left: <Avatar variant="rounded" sx={{ width: 48, height: 48 }}>
│  │   IF template.backgroundImage?.url: <img src=url alt={template.name} /> else: <DescriptionOutlined fontSize="large" color="action" />
│  ├─ Right of Avatar: <Stack direction="column" spacing={0.5} sx={{ flexGrow: 1 }}>
│  │   ├─ <Typography variant="body1" fontWeight="medium" noWrap>{template.name}</Typography>
│  │   └─ <Stack direction="row" spacing={1} alignItems="center">
│  │       ├─ <StatusBadge status={template.status} size="small" /> — colored dot + label
│  │       └─ <Typography variant="caption" color="text.secondary">{formatRelDate(template.updatedAt, locale)}</Typography>
│  └─ Right edge: <Checkbox
│      size="small"
│      checked={viewModel.selectedIds.has(template.id)}
│      onChange={() => viewModel.onToggleSelect(template.id)}
│      onClick={(e) => e.stopPropagation()} /> — prevents navigation when toggling checkbox
├─ Row 2 (below CardActionArea, optional visible only when category present):
│  <Chip size="small" label={template.category?.name} sx={{ color: "primary" }} /> + elementCount + variableCount inline labels
└─ Row 3 (action menu — collapsed under CardActionArea):
  <CardActionMenu template={template} actions={viewModel.availableActions(template)} labels={viewModel.labels.actions} />
  -- on mobile renders as horizontal row of IconButtons (max 3 visible), overflow into MoreHoriz icon popup
```

**Mobile-specific differences from desktop**:
- No "Grid/Table" view mode toggle (mobile always card list — no table)
- No search bar in header — search is sticky below header (within thumb reach)
- Filter is inline chip+bottom sheet (not popover)
- Avatar only 48×48 (desktop is 64×64 with 16:9 preview when backgroundImage exists)
- Checkbox NOT in a grid column — it's inline with the card content
- CardActionMenu items rendered as inline IconButtons when possible (not menu on desktop)
- No "Showing X of Y templates" in sticky status bar (reduced screen real estate) — count is at end of list

### Interaction States Summary

| State | Desktop Rendering | Mobile Rendering |
|-------|-------------------|------------------|
| **Initial loading** (first query) | `<SkeletonGrid columnCount={3} />` — 6 shimmer placeholder cards with Avatar, 3 text lines, Button | `<SkeletonList itemCount={6} />` — 6 single-column placeholder cards with Avatar and 2 text lines |
| **Load More loading** | "Load More" button shows `<CircularProgress size={20} />` inside and disables; existing grid/table remains visible | Inline `<CircularProgress>` replaces Load More button at list end; existing cards remain |
| **Error (query fail, initial)** | `<ErrorState>` replaces grid/table entirely: large error icon (ErrorOutlined), title=`labels.errors.loadFailed`, "Retry" button → `viewModel.onRetry()` (calls `refetch()`) | `<MobileErrorState>` same text/content, full-width centered |
| **Error (mutation fail)** | `<Snackbar severity="error" autoHideDuration={4000}>` at bottom-left; message from `labels.errors.{action}Failed`; action button hidden during error | Same Snackbar pattern, bottom-center on mobile |
| **Error (partial bulk failure)** | `<Snackbar severity="warning">`: "N succeeded, M failed"; if user taps, opens `<BatchResultDialog>` showing per-item failures | Same Snackbar + sheet for results details |
| **Empty (no templates)** | `<EmptyState>` with illustration, title=`labels.empty.noTemplatesTitle`, description, primary CTA button "Create first template" (hidden if `!canManage`) | Same content in `<MobileEmptyState>`, button full-width |
| **Filtered empty** | `<EmptyState>` title=`labels.empty.noMatchesTitle`, "Clear filters" CTA button → `viewModel.onClearAllFilters()` | Same mobile variant |
| **Disabled (permissions)** | Create button `disabled={!canManage}` (greyed out with tooltip explaining lack of permission). Card actions: hidden entirely (per-action permission gate via `availableActions`). Bulk bar buttons hidden if `!canPublish`/`!canManage` | FAB `disabled={!canManage}`. Inline card actions omitted if not permitted. Bulk bar IconButtons hidden if not permitted |
| **Success (mutation ok)** | `<Snackbar severity="success" autoHideDuration={3000}>` with message from `labels.{action}.success` or `labels.errors.ok`; auto-dismiss after 3s; no user action needed | Same Snackbar pattern, bottom-center |
| **Snackbar feedback** | Managed by store's `snackbarOpen`+`snackbarMessage`+`snackbarSeverity` fields; the ViewModel calls `showFeedback(message, severity)` on mutation complete/error. Snackbar rendered at container level (outside tier switch) so it survives tier switches | Same Snackbar component, rendered at container level alongside shared dialogs |

---

### Desktop View Specification

**File**: `frontend/desktop/views/dashboard/certificates/templates/templates.desktop.tsx`

The desktop tier view exports `DesktopTemplateListView({ ...viewModel }: Readonly<TemplateListViewModel>)` — a pure render component with ZERO hooks (except `useInView` for lazy-load trigger if needed), ZERO business logic, and ZERO store subscriptions. All data and handlers come from the destructured `viewModel` prop. The desktop view uses `PageContainer`, `PageHeader`, and `SectionPanel` from `@/frontend/common/components/ui/`.

#### Desktop Component Hierarchy (enhanced from §5 above)

```
┌─ <PageContainer>                           (width: 100%, maxWidth: theme.breakpoints.lg)
│  └─ <PageHeader>                           (slot="header")
│     ├─ <PageHeader.Title>                  → Typography variant="h4"
│     │   texts: viewModel.labels.pageTitle
│     ├─ <PageHeader.Subtitle>               → Typography variant="body2" color="text.secondary"
│     │   texts: viewModel.labels.pageSubtitle
│     └─ <PageHeader.Actions>                → Stack direction="row" spacing={2} alignItems="center"
│        ├─ <SearchBar> (TextField + StartAdornment=SearchOutlined + EndAdornment=ClearIcon when non-empty)
│        │   value: viewModel.searchQuery
│        │   onChange: viewModel.onSearchChange
│        │   placeholder: viewModel.labels.searchPlaceholder
│        ├─ <FilterButton> (Button + Badge activeCount)
│        │   onClick: viewModel.onOpenFilterPanel
│        │   activeCount: viewModel.activeFilterCount
│        ├─ <ViewModeToggle> (ToggleButtonGroup exclusive size="small")
│        │   value: viewModel.viewMode (grid|table)
│        │   onChange: viewModel.onViewModeChange
│        │   optionA: <GridViewOutlined /> with tooltip viewModel.labels.viewGrid
│        │   optionB: <TableRowsOutlined /> with tooltip viewModel.labels.viewTable
│        └─ <Button variant="contained" startIcon={<AddOutlined />}>
│            CreateButton — disabled if !viewModel.canManage
│            onClick: viewModel.onOpenCreateDialog
│            text: viewModel.labels.createButton
         </PageHeader.Actions>
└─ <PageHeader /> end

┌─ <FilterPanel> (when viewModel.filterPanelOpen)
│  rendered as a Popover anchored to FilterButton OR a Drawer anchor="right"
│  ├─ Status multi-select: 3 ToggleButtons (ALL+DRAFT+PUBLISHED+ARCHIVED) controlled by viewModel.statusFilter
│  ├─ Category: Autocomplete multiple + hierarchical display using viewModel.categories
│  │   disabled: viewModel.categoriesDisabled
│  │   helperText: viewModel.labels.filters.categoryComingSoon when disabled
│  └─ <Button text="Clear all" onClick={viewModel.onClearAllFilters} />
└─ <FilterPanel /> end

┌─ <SectionPanel>
│  ├─ Conditional rendering:
│  │   ├─ IF viewModel.loading (initial): <SkeletonGrid columnCount={3} rowsPerPage={2} /> (6 skeleton cards)
│  │   │   Pattern: skeleton TemplateCard placeholders with shimmer animation
│  │   ├─ IF viewModel.error && !viewModel.templates.length: <ErrorState>
│  │   │   title: viewModel.labels.errors.loadFailed
│  │   │   message: viewModel.error.message (for dev only — production uses generic翻译)
│  │   │   onRetry: viewModel.onRetry (calls refetch())
│  │   ├─ IF viewModel.isEmpty: <EmptyState
│  │   │       illustration="emptyState" title=viewModel.labels.empty.noTemplatesTitle
│  │   │       description=viewModel.labels.empty.noTemplatesDescription
│  │   │       primaryAction={canManage ? { label=viewModel.labels.empty.createFirstTemplate, onClick=viewModel.onOpenCreateDialog } : undefined}
│  │   │     />
│  │   ├─ IF viewModel.isFilteredEmpty: <EmptyState
│  │   │       title=viewModel.labels.empty.noMatchesTitle
│  │   │       description=viewModel.labels.empty.noMatchesDescription
│  │   │       primaryAction={ label=viewModel.labels.empty.clearFilters, onClick=viewModel.onClearAllFilters } />
│  │   ├─ IF viewModel.viewMode === 'grid': <TemplateCardGrid>
│  │   │   templates: viewModel.templates
│  │   │   selectedIds: viewModel.selectedIds
│  │   │   onToggleSelect: viewModel.onToggleSelect
│  │   │   onAction: viewModel.availableActions(template)[index].handler
│  │   │   actions: viewModel.availableActions(template)
│  │   │   labels: viewModel.labels
│  │   └─ IF viewModel.viewMode === 'table': <TemplateTable>
│  │       templates, selectedIds, handlers, columns (see below)
│  │
│  ├─ Pagination control:
│  │   <LoadMoreButton
│  │     visible: viewModel.pageInfo.hasNextPage
│  │     loading: viewModel.loadingMore
│  │     onClick: viewModel.onLoadMore
│  │     label: viewModel.labels.pagination.loadMore
│  │     loadingLabel: viewModel.labels.pagination.loading
│  │   />
│  │
│  └─ <CountDisplay> stateless: {viewModel.labels.pagination.count(viewModel.loadedCount, viewModel.totalCount)}
└─ <SectionPanel /> end

┌─ <BulkActionBar> (when viewModel.selectedIds.size > 0, sticky bottom per DD-4)
│  <BulKActionBar> is rendered OUTSIDE SectionPanel (sibling of PageContainer+SectionPanel)
│  positioned fixed (see DD-4), width: constrained to content area offset by sidebar
│  children:
│  ├─ <Chip> → viewModel.labels.bulkActions.selectedCount(viewModel.selectedIds.size) — Arabic plural
│  ├─ <Button text=Archive disabled=loading?/> → visible when viewModel.canPublish, onClick: viewModel.onBulkArchive
│  ├─ <Button text=Delete /> → visible when viewModel.canManage, onClick: viewModel.onBulkDelete
│  ├─ <Button text=ChangeCategory /> → visible when viewModel.canManage, onClick: viewModel.onOpenBulkChangeCategory
│  └─ <Button text=Cancel onClick=viewModel.onClearSelection /> always visible
└─ <BulkActionBar /> end
```

#### AppDataGrid Column Definitions (TemplateTable)

`TemplateTable` uses `AppDataGrid` from `@/frontend/common/components/ui/` for the table view. Columns below are defined in a constant array passed to AppDataGrid's `columns` prop. Checkbox selection is handled via AppDataGrid's built-in `checkboxSelection` prop — the `selectedIds` from the ViewModel is passed to AppDataGrid's `rowSelectionModel`:

| # | Field | headerName (labelKey) | width | renderCell | sortable | align |
|---|-------|----------------------|-------|------------|----------|-------|
| 1 | — (checkbox) | AppDataGrid built-in `checkboxSelection` | 50 | AppDataGrid renders native MUI checkbox | N/A | center |
| 2 | `name` | `labels.table.name` ("Template Name") | 200 | `<Stack direction="row" spacing={1}>` with `<Avatar variant="square" src="backgroundImage?.url" sx={{ width: 32, height: 32 }}>` + `<Typography noWrap>{row.name}</Typography>` (Avatar displays generic DescriptionIcon fallback when no backgroundImage) | `true` (client sort) | left |
| 3 | `category` | `labels.table.category` ("Category") | 150 | `<Chip size="small" label={row.category?.name ?? labels.table.uncategorized} />` | `false` | left |
| 4 | `status` | `labels.table.status` ("Status") | 100 | `<StatusBadge status={row.status} />` (StatusBadge component from `@/frontend/common/components/ui/`) | `true` | left |
| 5 | `elementCount` | `labels.table.elementCount` ("Elements") | 80 | `<Stack direction="row" spacing={0.5}><WidgetOutlined fontSize="small" /><Typography variant="body2">{labels.elementCount(row.elementCount)}</Typography></Stack>` | `true` | right |
| 6 | `variableCount` | `labels.table.variableCount` ("Variables") | 80 | `<Stack direction="row" spacing={0.5}><VariableOutlined fontSize="small" /><Typography variant="body2">{labels.variableCount(row.variableCount)}</Typography></Stack>` | `true` | right |
| 7 | `updatedAt` | `labels.table.modified` ("Modified") | 120 | relative-date wrapper `<Typography variant="body2">{formatRelDate(row.updatedAt, locale)}</Typography>` (relative date from shared util) | `true` (default sort desc) | left |
| 8 | — (actions) | empty header | 60 | `<CardActionMenu template={row} actions={availableActions(row)} labels={labels.actions} />` — renders IconButton with MoreHorizOutlined and Menu popup | `false` | center |

**Row click handler**: `onRowClick` → calls `viewModel.onEdit(row.id)` (navigate to editor). **Row selection**: `onSelectionModelChange` → updates store via `onToggleSelect(id)`. **Density**: `"standard"` (default). **Pagination**: off — server-side Load More is used; AppDataGrid `pagination={false}` shows all loaded rows, user clicks "Load More" below grid. Operator selector: filterable rows allows typing in column header filter inputs when available in AppDataGrid.

### Mobile View Specification

(Mobile component hierarchy and MobileTemplateCard layout are specified in the enhanced §5 above under "Mobile Component Hierarchy (enhanced)" and "MobileTemplateCard Layout".)

