## 6. Data Model References

This plan consumes types and data from Plan 05's GraphQL schema. It does not create any database tables or backend schemas.

### GraphQL Types Consumed (from Plan 05)

| Type | Source Plan | Used For |
|------|------------|----------|
| `CertTemplate` | Plan 05 GraphQL object | Card/row display fields, mutation return type |
| `CertTemplateConnection` | Plan 05 relay connection | Cursor pagination (edges, pageInfo, totalCount) |
| `CertTemplateEdge` | Plan 05 relay edge | `node` (CertTemplate) + `cursor` |
| `PageInfo` | Plan 05 relay pageInfo | `hasNextPage`, `endCursor` for pagination |
| `TemplateStatus` | Plan 05 enum | Status filter, status badge (DRAFT, PUBLISHED, ARCHIVED) |
| `CertTemplateFilterInput` | Plan 05 input | Search + filter arguments to `certTemplates` query |
| `CertTemplateSortInput` | Plan 05 input | Sort field + direction (default: updatedAt DESC) |
| `BatchResult` | Plan 05 return | Bulk mutation result (successCount, failureCount, failures) |
| `Category` | Plan 09 (via Plan 05 schema) | Category filter dropdown, category chip on card |

### Database Tables (Reference Only — Read via Plan 05 API)

| Table | Usage | Plan that Creates Schema |
|-------|-------|--------------------------|
| `certificate_templates` | List query, create/duplicate/delete mutations | Plan 1 |
| `certificate_categories` | Category filter dropdown, category chip display | Plan 1 |

### Consumed Fields (CertTemplate — List View)

| Field | GraphQL Type | Used In |
|------|-------------|---------|
| `id` | `ID!` | Apollo cache key, card key, navigation |
| `name` | `String!` | Card title, search match, table column |
| `status` | `TemplateStatus!` | Status badge, status filter |
| `category` | `Category` (nullable, object) | Category chip, category filter |
| `backgroundImage` | `Image?` (nullable) | Thumbnail preview (16:9 on desktop/tablet) |
| `updatedAt` | `DateTime!` | "Last modified" display, default sort |
| `elementCount` | `Int!` | Element count display with icon |
| `variableCount` | `Int!` | Variable count display with icon |

### Consumed Mutations (from Plan 05)

| Mutation | Input | Returns | Used By |
|----------|-------|---------|---------|
| `createTemplate` | `{ name, categoryId?, orientation, pageSize }` | `CertTemplate` | CreateTemplateDialog |
| `duplicateTemplate` | `{ id }` | `CertTemplate` | CardActionMenu "Duplicate" |
| `deleteTemplate` | `{ id }` | `Boolean` | CardActionMenu "Delete" / DeleteConfirmDialog |
| `bulkArchiveTemplates` | `{ ids: [ID] }` | `BatchResult` | BulkActionBar "Archive" |
| `bulkDeleteTemplates` | `{ ids: [ID] }` | `BatchResult` | BulkActionBar "Delete" |
| `bulkChangeCategory` | `{ ids: [ID], categoryId }` | `BatchResult` | BulkActionBar "Change Category" / BulkChangeCategoryDialog |

