## 8. i18n Design

### 8.1 Namespace Structure

```
shared/locale/
├── types/
│   └── dashboard/
│       └── certificates/
│           └── templates/
│               └── list.ts          ← TemplateListLabels interface
├── namespaces/
│   └── dashboard/
│       └── certificates/
│           └── templates/
│               └── list.namespace.ts ← defineNamespace registration
├── ar/
│   └── dashboard/
│       └── certificates/
│           └── templates/
│               └── list.ts          ← Arabic implementation (with pluralization)
└── en/
    └── dashboard/
        └── certificates/
            └── templates/
                └── list.ts          ← English implementation (with pluralization)
```

### 8.2 Registration Points (6 files to create/edit)

1. **Create** `shared/locale/types/dashboard/certificates/templates/list.ts` — `TemplateListLabels` interface with all key groups: `pageTitle`, `pageSubtitle`, `searchPlaceholder`, `createButton`, `viewGrid`, `viewTable`, `selectAll`, `elementCount`, `variableCount`, `status.*` (draft, published, archived), `filters.*` (title, statusLabel, categoryLabel, clearAll, activeCount), `pagination.*` (loadMore, loading, count), `actions.*` (edit, preview, duplicate, delete, generate, deleteConfirmTitle, deleteConfirmWarning, deleteConfirmButton, deleteCancelButton), `bulkActions.*` (archive, delete, changeCategory, cancel, selectedCount), `empty.*` (noTemplatesTitle, noTemplatesDescription, createFirstTemplate, noMatchesTitle, noMatchesDescription, clearFilters), `errors.*` (loadFailed, retry, createFailed, duplicateFailed, deleteFailed, permissionDenied, bulkActionFailed), `createDialog.*` (title, nameLabel, namePlaceholder, categoryLabel, orientationLabel, portrait, landscape, pageSizeLabel, a4, letter, custom, submit, cancel, nameRequired, nameTooLong), `sidebar.*` (groupLabel, templates, categories, recipientGroups, certificates, verificationLog)

2. **Create** `shared/locale/ar/dashboard/certificates/templates/list.ts` — Arabic implementation with pluralization for `pagination.count(loaded, total)` (6-form CLDR), `bulkActions.selectedCount(count)` (6-form CLDR), `elementCount(count)` (6-form CLDR), `variableCount(count)` (6-form CLDR), and interpolation for `actions.deleteConfirmWarning(status)`

3. **Create** `shared/locale/en/dashboard/certificates/templates/list.ts` — English implementation with pluralization (one/other) for count functions and interpolation for `deleteConfirmWarning(status)`

4. **Create** `shared/locale/namespaces/dashboard/certificates/templates/list.namespace.ts` — `defineNamespace("dashboard.certificates.templates.list", { load: { en, ar } })`

5. **Edit** `shared/locale/namespaces/translation.ts` — Add `Dashboard: { ...existing, Certificates: { ...existing, Templates: { List: DashboardCertificatesTemplatesList } } }` to the `Translation` registry

6. **Edit** `shared/locale/types/message.ts` — Add `TemplateListLabels` to `MessageSchema` type under `Dashboard.Certificates.Templates.List`

### 8.2.1 Type Schema Definition (`TemplateListLabels` interface)

The `TemplateListLabels` interface in `shared/locale/types/dashboard/certificates/templates/list.ts` defines all translation keys as a typed object. Each key is either `string` or a typed function. The structure mirrors the key groups below:

- Root keys: `pageTitle: string`, `pageSubtitle: string`, `searchPlaceholder: string`, `createButton: string`, `viewGrid: string`, `viewTable: string`, `selectAll: string`, `elementCount: (count: number) => string`, `variableCount: (count: number) => string`
- `status`: `{ draft: string; published: string; archived: string }`
- `filters`: `{ title: string; statusLabel: string; categoryLabel: string; orientationLabel: string; clearAll: string; activeCount: (count: number) => string }`
- `sort`: `{ label: string; fields: { name: string; updatedAt: string; createdAt: string; status: string; elementCount: string; variableCount: string }; directionAsc: string; directionDesc: string }`
- `pagination`: `{ loadMore: string; loading: string; count: (loaded: number, total: number) => string }`
- `actions`: `{ edit: string; preview: string; duplicate: string; delete: string; generate: string; deleteConfirmTitle: string; deleteConfirmWarning: (status: string) => string; deleteConfirmButton: string; deleteCancelButton: string }`
- `bulkActions`: `{ archive: string; delete: string; changeCategory: string; cancel: string; selectedCount: (count: number) => string }`
- `empty`: `{ noTemplatesTitle: string; noTemplatesDescription: string; createFirstTemplate: string; noMatchesTitle: string; noMatchesDescription: string; clearFilters: string }`
- `errors`: `{ loadFailed: string; retry: string; createFailed: string; duplicateFailed: string; deleteFailed: string; permissionDenied: string; bulkActionFailed: string }`
- `createDialog`: `{ title: string; nameLabel: string; namePlaceholder: string; categoryLabel: string; uncategorized: string; orientationLabel: string; portrait: string; landscape: string; pageSizeLabel: string; a4: string; letter: string; custom: string; submit: string; cancel: string; nameRequired: string; nameTooLong: (maximum: number) => string }`
- `sidebar`: `{ groupLabel: string; templates: string; categories: string; recipientGroups: string; certificates: string; verificationLog: string }`

The namespace file registers via `defineNamespace("dashboard.certificates.templates.list", { load: { en, ar } })`. EN and AR implementations must match this interface exactly — TypeScript compilation will fail if any key is missing.

