### 8.4 Arabic Pluralization Rules

| Key Group | Contains | Example Keys |
|-----------|----------|-------------|
| `certificates.templates.list` (root) | Page title, subtitle, search placeholder, buttons, view mode labels, count labels | `pageTitle`, `pageSubtitle`, `searchPlaceholder`, `createButton`, `viewGrid`, `viewTable`, `selectAll` |
| `certificates.templates.list.status` | Status badge labels | `draft`, `published`, `archived` |
| `certificates.templates.list.filters` | Filter panel labels | `title`, `statusLabel`, `categoryLabel`, `categoryComingSoon`, `clearAll`, `activeCount(count)` |
| `certificates.templates.list.pagination` | Pagination controls | `loadMore`, `loading`, `count(loaded, total)` |
| `certificates.templates.list.actions` | Card action menu labels, confirmations, toasts | `edit`, `preview`, `duplicate`, `delete`, `generate`, `deleteConfirmTitle`, `deleteConfirmWarning(status)`, `deleteConfirmButton`, `deleteCancelButton` |
| `certificates.templates.list.bulkActions` | Bulk action bar | `archive`, `delete`, `changeCategory`, `cancel`, `selectedCount(count)` |
| `certificates.templates.list.empty` | Empty state | `noTemplatesTitle`, `noTemplatesDescription`, `createFirstTemplate`, `noMatchesTitle`, `noMatchesDescription`, `clearFilters` |
| `certificates.templates.list.errors` | Error messages | `loadFailed`, `retry`, `createFailed`, `duplicateFailed`, `deleteFailed`, `permissionDenied`, `bulkActionFailed` |
| `certificates.templates.list.createDialog` | Create template dialog | `title`, `nameLabel`, `namePlaceholder`, `categoryLabel`, `uncategorized`, `orientationLabel`, `portrait`, `landscape`, `pageSizeLabel`, `a4`, `letter`, `custom`, `submit`, `cancel`, `nameRequired`, `nameTooLong(max)` |
| `certificates.sidebar` | Sidebar navigation | `groupLabel`, `templates`, `categories`, `recipientGroups`, `certificates`, `verificationLog` |

### 8.4 Arabic Pluralization Rules

The Arabic pluralization system follows CLDR 6-form morphological categories:

| Category | Condition | Pattern (قالب = template) | Example |
|----------|-----------|---------------------------|---------|
| Zero | `count === 0` | "لا توجد قوالب" | "No templates" |
| One | `count === 1` | "قالب واحد" | "One template" |
| Two | `count === 2` | "قالبان" | "Two templates" |
| Few | `count >= 3 && count <= 10` | "{count} قوالب" | "5 templates" |
| Many | `count >= 11 && count <= 99` | "{count} قالباً" | "50 templates" |
| Other | `count >= 100` | "{count} قالب" | "200 templates" |

These are implemented as typed `(count: number) => string` functions in the locale schema, with each locale file providing the correct morphological form.

**Pluralized keys**:
- `pagination.count(loaded: number, total: number)` — uses `total` for pluralization form, interpolates both `loaded` and `total`
- `bulkActions.selectedCount(count: number)` — uses `count` for pluralization form
- `elementCount(count: number)` — element count on card
- `variableCount(count: number)` — variable count on card
- `filters.activeCount(count: number)` — active filter count badge

**English pluralization**: `count === 1 → one form`; all others → other form

### 8.5 Interpolation Keys

| Key | Signature | EN Pattern | AR Pattern |
|-----|-----------|-----------|-----------|
| `pagination.count` | `(loaded: number, total: number) => string` | "Showing {loaded} of {total} templates" | Pluralized by `total` (see §8.4) |
| `actions.deleteConfirmWarning` | `(status: string) => string` | "This template is {status}. Deleting it will remove it from the active list. This action can be undone by an administrator." | "هذا القالب {status}. سيؤدي حذفه إلى إزالته من القائمة النشطة. يمكن للمسؤول التراجع عن هذا الإجراء." |
| `createDialog.nameTooLong` | `(max: number) => string` | "Name must be {max} characters or less" | "يجب أن يكون الاسم {max} حرفاً أو أقل" |

### 8.6 Access Patterns

| Context | Access |
|---------|--------|
| Server component (`page.tsx`) | `getTranslations(locale).dashboardTranslations.certificates.templates.list` |
| Client component (Container, Views) | `useAppTranslation(Translation.Dashboard.Certificates.Templates.List)` |
| Sidebar navigation | `useAppTranslation(Translation.Dashboard.Certificates.Sidebar)` (from `certificates.sidebar` namespace — registered alongside the list namespace or as part of the same namespace file) |

