|------|--------|
| `frontend/common/stores/AGENTS.md` | Add note about URL-persisted vs localStorage-persisted state pattern (filters in URL, viewMode in localStorage) |
| `frontend/common/graphql/sharedDocuments/AGENTS.md` | Add example of relay connection query with cursor pagination + `fetchMore` merge function |
| `frontend/views/AGENTS.md` | Add note about card grid + table toggle pattern in desktop tier views |
| `shared/AGENTS.md` | Add note about Arabic 6-form CLDR pluralization pattern for count functions |

### 10.9 Instruction File Update Notes (for Plan 21 to incorporate)

| File | Update |
|------|--------|
| `.github/instructions/frontend.instructions.md` | Add rule: "List pages must persist filter/search/pagination state in URL search params; view mode preference in localStorage via Zustand persist middleware" |

