### 10.8 Role-Based Access Matrix

| Feature | SUPER_ADMIN | ACADEMY_ADMIN | TEACHER | SUPERVISOR |
|---------|-------------|----------------|---------|------------|
| View templates | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ (own academy) | ✓ (own academy) |
| Create template | ✓ | ✓ | ✗ | ✗ |
| Edit template | ✓ | ✓ | ✗ | ✗ |
| Delete template | ✓ | ✓ | ✗ | ✗ |
| Publish template | ✓ | ✓ | ✗ | ✗ |
| Duplicate template | ✓ | ✓ | ✗ | ✗ |

#### Permission Enforcement

- Sidebar items render only if the user has the corresponding `read` permission.
- "Create Template" button renders only if `cert.template.create` is granted.
- `TemplateCard` and `TemplateListTable` action buttons (Edit, Duplicate, Delete, Publish) render/enable based on `cert.template.update`, `cert.template.create`, `cert.template.delete` respectively.
- Bulk actions bar (Archive, Delete, Export) gate on the same permissions as their single-item equivalents.

### 10.9 Zustand Template List Store Interface

```typescript
interface TemplateListState {
  // Data
  templates: CertTemplateReturnType[];
  loading: boolean;
  error: string | null;

  // Filters & UI
  searchQuery: string;
  categoryFilter: string | 'all';
  statusFilter: string | 'all';
  sortBy: 'modified' | 'name-asc' | 'name-desc' | 'newest';
  viewMode: 'card' | 'table';
  selectedIds: string[];
  createDialogOpen: boolean;

  // Actions
  loadTemplates: (variables?: CertTemplateListQueryVariables) => Promise<void>;
  setSearchQuery: (query: string) => void;
  setCategoryFilter: (category: string | 'all') => void;
  setStatusFilter: (status: string | 'all') => void;
  setSortBy: (sortBy: TemplateListState['sortBy']) => void;
  setViewMode: (mode: 'card' | 'table') => void;
  toggleSelection: (id: string) => void;
  clearSelection: () => void;
  openCreateDialog: () => void;
  closeCreateDialog: () => void;
  createTemplate: (input: CertTemplateCreateInput) => Promise<CertTemplateReturnType>;
  duplicateTemplate: (id: string) => Promise<void>;
  deleteTemplate: (id: string) => Promise<void>;
  archiveTemplate: (id: string) => Promise<void>;
}
```

#### Store Implementation Notes

| Aspect | Detail |
|--------|--------|
| **Location** | `frontend/stores/cert/templateListStore.ts` (following project Zustand store convention) |
| **Persistence** | `viewMode` persisted to `localStorage` via `persist` middleware; all other state is non-persisted |
| **Selected IDs** | `Set<string>` internally, exposed as `string[]` for components — follows `frontend/common/stores/AGENTS.md` serialization rule |
| **Apollo cache** | After `deleteTemplate`/`duplicateTemplate`/`archiveTemplate`, call `client.cache.evict()` or `client.refetchQueries()` to sync with `CERT_TEMPLATES_QUERY` |
| **Optimistic updates** | `deleteTemplate` applies optimistic removal from `templates` array with rollback on error (DD-6 from existing design) |

